{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Pixel Invaders 是一款重現懷舊氛圍的經典復古射擊遊戲，讓玩家在忙碌生活中重拾童年電玩樂趣。這款作品以簡潔直觀的操作方式，帶領玩家體驗對抗外星入侵者的刺激戰鬥，目前正提供限時免費下載，無需支付原價 US $0.99 即可擁有完整遊戲體驗。</p>\n\n<h2>挑戰外星人海與飛碟Boss</h2>\n<p>玩家需擊退層層逼近的外星軍隊，並躲避敵方火力以累積積分。隨著關卡推進，敵人移動速度將顯著加快，從第 4 關起母艦 UFO 會定期出現，而第 8 關後更將遭遇難以擊毀的 UFO 戰機，考驗玩家的反應速度與精準度，成功消滅這些特殊目標可獲得額外獎勵分數。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-81-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-82-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-83-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-84-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-85-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Pixel Invaders Retro Edition</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T23:22:07.386550+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}